# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in values. See ENV_SETUP_GUIDE.md for full list.
#
# Firestore: dev defaults to long-polling (avoids Listen/channel 400 on some setups).
# Set to false only if you need to debug the WebChannel transport.
# VITE_FIRESTORE_FORCE_LONG_POLLING=false
#
# --- Local full stack (npm run dev + remote API) ---
# Proxies browser requests from http://localhost:<vite-port>/api/* to your deployed app (Vite is often 5173).
# If Firebase sign-in fails with auth/requests-from-referer-localhost:5173-are-blocked, add that origin to your
# Google Cloud Browser API key HTTP referrers. See docs/LOCAL_DEV.md.
# Use your Vercel production or preview URL (no trailing slash).
# DEV_API_PROXY=https://your-app.vercel.app
#
# --- Custom storefront domains (stormijxo.com → / without /handle in path) ---
# Comma-separated; matching ignores leading www. Requires creatorDomains/{host} in Firestore.
# VITE_CUSTOM_STOREFRONT_HOSTS=stormijxo.com,www.stormijxo.com
